doffs, the exception management, the reconciliation — is where margin, risk, and customer trust are actually determined."}]]]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"py-20 bg-gray-50","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl text-navy-900 mb-6","children":["PROCESSES: ","FINANCIAL PROCESSORS"," OPERATIONS"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-gold-600 h-1 w-24 mb-12"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 p-8 hover:border-gold-600 transition-colors","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl text-navy-900 font-bold mb-3","children":"Transaction Authorization"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Receiving, validating, and decisioning real-time transaction requests against rules, limits, and risk parameters. The process where milliseconds and accuracy are non-negotiable."}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 p-8 hover:border-gold-600 transition-colors","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl text-navy-900 font-bold mb-3","children":"Transaction Clearing & Settlement"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Aggregating, netting, and settling authorized transactions between parties. The process where timing, accuracy, and regulatory compliance converge."}]]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 p-8 hover:border-gold-600 transition-colors","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl text-navy-900 font-bold mb-3","children":"Merchant Onboarding & Underwriting"}],"$L18"]}],"$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25"]}]]}]}],"$L26","$L27","$L28"]}]
